{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24576","headline":"池上幽境 · 白居易","name":"池上幽境","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"褭褭过水桥，微微入林路。\n幽境深谁知，老身闲独步。\n行行何所爱，遇物自成趣。\n平滑青盘石，低密绿阴树。\n石上一素琴，树下双草屦。\n此是荣先生，坐禅三乐处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}